From a941730f042f4dcc3f0de50e6cbf4c5c16fb5320 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devi Priya <devipriy@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 17:36:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] serial: qcom-geni: Add GSI mode support for non-console UART

Currently UART supports only FIFO and DMA modes.
This change adds GSI mode support for non-console UART
by loading the required GSI firmware and initializing
the GSI registers before configuring the SE to operate in GSI mode.

Change-Id: I4a66413836096f7e1cf41a30e9d85d4e29f1e5b0
Signed-off-by: Devi Priya <devipriy@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c                | 605 +++++++++++++++-
 drivers/tty/serial/qcom_geni_serial.c | 964 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 include/linux/dma/qcom-gpi-dma.h      |  90 +++
 3 files changed, 1631 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c b/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c
index 1c93864e0e4d..ed5e5e758f3f 100644
--- a/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c
+++ b/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c
@@ -6,12 +6,14 @@
 
 #include <dt-bindings/dma/qcom-gpi.h>
